##### [§](#history)History

In previous releases of Ratatui this method accepted `Into<Title>` instead of [`Into<Line>`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/convert/trait.Into.html "trait core::convert::Into"). We found that storing the position in the block and the alignment in the line better reflects the intended use of the block and its titles. See [https://github.com/ratatui/ratatui/issues/738](https://github.com/ratatui/ratatui/issues/738) for more information.

